                            	  3075: 
                            	  3076:     ; T39 HUD row guard (Stage B + Stage C + Stage D + P45 + perf-hoist):
                            	  3077:     ; NT_CACHE rows 0-6 (offsets $000-$0DF) may contain either legitimate
                            	  3078:     ; HUD text (OW mode) or stomped playfield data (cave modes). Skip the
                            	  3079:     ; tile only when the hoisted cave-mode flag D7 is set. Computation of
