                            	   515: UpdateBlock_JumpTable:
02:0003844C 00038458        	   516:     dc.l    UpdateBlock0Idle   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00038450 00038532        	   517:     dc.l    UpdateBlock1Moving   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00038454 0003857C        	   518:     dc.l    UpdateBlock2Done   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
