                            	  2152: SecretArmosXs:
02:00038FC4 E0              	  2153:     dc.b    $E0, $B0, $B0, $30, $40, $90, $A0
02:00038FC5 B0
02:00038FC6 B0
02:00038FC7 30
02:00038FC8 40
02:00038FC9 90
02:00038FCA A0
